## Interface: 120000, 120001, 120005
## Title: MythicPlusPageExtension
## Version: 12.0.B4
## Author: CN2714
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\MythicPlusPageExtension\icon.tga
## Notes: Mythic Plus Page Extension: This addon enhances the Mythic+ interface by displaying your best score and highest completed level for each dungeon. It features one-click dungeon teleport usage with raid announcements, automatic Keystone information sharing within your party, and provides a weekly Mythic+ summary report.
## Notes-zhCN: 史诗钥石地下城界面扩展工具，显示单本最佳分数、最高通关层数、点击使用传送门并通报、小队信息展示及钥石共享，大秘境周报。
